AHCSRGCVR01M1N3F77T","relation":"supports","source_id":"rsrc_4370PDXKRBFTE6TS01M1N3F77J"}],"claims":[{"campaign_id":"rcamp_DVXATRP0N41EZQ9601M1N3F77T","claim_class":"target","created_at":"2026-09-04T02:20:24.745Z","goal_id":"goal_0YJGMZWAHCSRGCVR01M1N3F77T","id":"rclm_6M6R3D10Q9R4CSZ001M1N3F77J","text":"Local canonical Phase B (canonical DB revision/IDs/chain, tracked packs, wiki check) remains mandatory before any closure; this bundle is cloud Phase A evidence only and the ticket stays READY_FOR_CANONICALIZATION."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_DVXATRP0N41EZQ9601M1N3F77T","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-09-04T02:20:24.744Z","goal_id":"goal_0YJGMZWAHCSRGCVR01M1N3F77T","id":"rclm_8TQF5YJP2PVV3EKD01M1N3F77J","text":"CWE-74 defines the injection weakness class where improperly neutralized special elements in output used by others change control flow; tool-output content is data, never commands."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_DVXATRP0N41EZQ9601M1N3F77T","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-09-04T02:20:24.744Z","goal_id":"goal_0YJGMZWAHCSRGCVR01M1N3F77T","id":"rclm_AA826MNV9PSCM1D201M1N3F77J","text":"SLSA v1.1 defines provenance and verification levels for build artifacts; supply-chain changes must be detected by provenance and digest comparisons, not by trust."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_DVXATRP0N41EZQ9601M1N3F77T","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-09-04T02:20:24.744Z","goal_id":"goal_0YJGMZWAHCSRGCVR01M1N3F77T","id":"rclm_B8YFAHQ9FVNJS22501M1N3F77J","text":"MITRE ATLAS catalogues adversarial-ML techniques that motivate tool-poisoning defenses, including LLM prompt injection (AML.T0051) and poisoned training data (AML.T0020)."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_DVXATRP0N41EZQ9601M1N3F77T","claim_class":"assumption","created_at":"2026-09-04T02:20:24.745Z","goal_id":"goal_0YJGMZWAHCSRGCVR01M1N3F77T","id":"rclm_BYE4YG6CWHSP3T2801M1N3F77J","text":"In the evaluated model pre_approved is a boolean entitlement; exact-action+operation+expiry approval binding is declared by the contract but not enforced by the deterministic evaluator and must be enforced by the production gateway."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_DVXATRP0N41EZQ9601M1N3F77T","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-09-04T02:20:24.744Z","goal_id":"goal_0YJGMZWAHCSRGCVR01M1N3F77T","id":"rclm_E77BM0Z79DGX61VJ01M1N3F77J","text":"The AgentOS gateway treats registered context as the only authoritative capability/policy source; approvals live in registered_context.pre_approved, and external content can never create, consume, or extend authority."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_DVXATRP0N41EZQ9601M1N3F77T","claim_class":"assumption","created_at":"2026-09-04T02:20:24.745Z","goal_id":"goal_0YJGMZWAHCSRGCVR01M1N3F77T","id":"rclm_F10Q9E84GFZHPH6S01M1N3F77J","text":"Deterministic pattern layers cannot cover unseen obfuscation families; the evaluated defense is routing-level (quarantine/human review), not universal detection."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_DVXATRP0N41EZQ9601M1N3F77T","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-09-04T02:20:24.744Z","goal_id":"goal_0YJGMZWAHCSRGCVR01M1N3F77T","id":"rclm_GC1F7A8HRRDM3AXZ01M1N3F77J","text":"NIST SP 800-218 (SSDF) requires verification of component integrity and provenance of build inputs (PO tasks) for software supply chains."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_DVXATRP0N41EZQ9601M1N3F77T","claim_class":"inference","created_at":"2026-09-04T02:20:24.744Z","goal_id":"goal_0YJGMZWAHCSRGCVR01M1N3F77T","id":"rclm_HY558ZTGYCCG136801M1N3F77J","text":"Detector faults, scanner disagreement, malformed inputs, unknown effects, and revocation all route to DENY/QUARANTINE/HUMAN_REVIEW/UNSUPPORTED and never collapse to ALLOW; quarantine/human-review routing carries the residual risk of unseen obfuscation families."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_DVXATRP0N41EZQ9601M1N3F77T","claim_class":"inference","created_at":"2026-09-04T02:20:24.744Z","goal_id":"goal_0YJGMZWAHCSRGCVR01M1N3F77T","id":"rclm_QYFSMBHRE6JZJ01201M1N3F77J","text":"On the frozen 56-case corpus the layered controls blocked every malicious case (recall 1.0, Wilson 95% lower bound recorded in metrics), with zero critical escapes and zero authority expansions across two process-separated runs."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_DVXATRP0N41EZQ9601M1N3F77T","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-09-04T02:20:24.744Z","goal_id":"goal_0YJGMZWAHCSRGCVR01M1N3F77T","id":"rclm_V6RVM09SZVQEWZG901M1N3F77J","text":"Wilson score intervals are the standard method for binomial proportion confidence intervals on small detection corpora."}],"current_chain_hash":"8442d0dee8992f77f364ca7bfa1383babba4c5fca5beef9eb5ed0315d9010269","evaluations":[{"artifact_chain_hash":"8442d0dee8992f77f364ca7bfa1383babba4c5fca5beef9eb5ed0315d9010269","campaign_id":"rcamp_DVXATRP0N41EZQ9601M1N3F77T","created_at":"2026-09-04T02:20:24.757Z","details":{"audit":{"auditor":"verifier-B","limitations":["Same-host process separation (verifier-A/verifier-B runner processes with distinct evaluator children), not an external human auditor or independently implemented auditor.","Cloud Phase A proves tracked Git evidence only; canonical DB state is rechecked in local Phase B.","pre_approved is a boolean entitlement in the evaluated model; exact-action+operation+expiry approval binding must be enforced by the production gateway."],"producer":"verifier-A","subject_producer":"verifier-A","verdict":"pass_with_limits"},"config":{"min_source_count":3,"min_verified_ratio":1.0,"required_artifacts":["research_plan","source_registry","feature_catalog","architecture_models","mental_model","ontology","mathematical_model","synthesis_and_gaps","independent_audit","platform_plan","progress"]},"next_actions":[]},"evaluation_version":1,"goal_id":"goal_0YJGMZWAHCSRGCVR01M1N3F77T","id":"reval_R3Y7MD5STXP6SR3101M1N3F79N","limitations":["Same-host process separation (verifier-A/verifier-B runner processes with distinct evaluator children), not an external human auditor or independently implemented auditor.","Cloud Phase A proves tracked Git evidence only; canonical DB state is rechecked in local Phase B